  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Carnival 2013 Spring introduced PokéCard Points, earned by entering and winning its side events: 3-on-3 team battles, a Limited Battle without Pokémon-EX, the all-day One-Day Battle and battles against staff dressed as Gym Leaders and Team Plasma. Points bought prizes, from stamped basic Energy cards at one point each to, for ten points, an alternate-art holo Darkrai-EX stamped with the event's logo. The Battle Carnival was held in Fukuoka, Nagoya, Chiba and Osaka in May 2013.",
